{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094300/extras/a5b8553dfc9ddc7f6eb6f255502683d6.avif?t=1762206324\" width=783 height=278 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094300/extras/6b01613ad783fbc4715be6850c20d53c.avif?t=1762206324\" width=783 height=78 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>HWTC</i> is a mix of psychological horror and work simulation set in the fictional post-Soviet state, the Republic of Calvania. You\u2019ll be exploring difficult themes that are part of our everyday lives - routine, negligence, and mental health - all while listening to the encouraging, Council-approved radio station.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Few things are said directly, but many are left for your interpretation. The warehouse, the notes, and the radio tell a story - but you\u2019re the one who puts it together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Getting most of the achievements and story elements will take around 2\u20133 hours, but the game doesn\u2019t end there - you can complete as many shifts as you like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094300/extras/aa3b09b81b9e6322dd4cf0f30c30ed91.poster.avif?t=1762206324\" width=800 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094300/extras/aa3b09b81b9e6322dd4cf0f30c30ed91.webm?t=1762206324\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094300/extras/aa3b09b81b9e6322dd4cf0f30c30ed91.mp4?t=1762206324\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094300/extras/f22418d64276cc6e82ae456265338107.avif?t=1762206324\" width=783 height=78 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Your working shifts are the core of the game - you <strong>check</strong>, <strong>pack</strong>, and <strong>send orders</strong>. Hard work and attention to detail are rewarded; carelessness, on the other hand, is noticed and punished.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Each day is an <strong>eight-hour night shift</strong> with no limit on the number of orders you can pack. Every shift, <strong>the conveyor configuration changes</strong>, making your tasks easier or harder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Your time and space management will be thoroughly tested - you\u2019ll need <strong>shelves</strong> to organize your work, an eye for detail to spot signs of <strong>electric fuses</strong> nearing their limits, and careful planning to stay <strong>sane</strong> throughout the process.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094300/extras/bff9f21e80c0d9ba3cfab8718958222b.poster.avif?t=1762206324\" width=800 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094300/extras/bff9f21e80c0d9ba3cfab8718958222b.webm?t=1762206324\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094300/extras/bff9f21e80c0d9ba3cfab8718958222b.mp4?t=1762206324\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094300/extras/b11d3459b467549f8fecc83e197e8dd1.avif?t=1762206324\" width=783 height=78 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Work is demanding, tiring, and you\u2019ve already suffered enough. The closer you get to a <strong>mental breakdown</strong>, the more unfriendly things become - whispers, flickering lights, silent conveyor belts. But don\u2019t worry - <strong>the game isn\u2019t about jump scares</strong>; it\u2019s about a dense, dark atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">And if you\u2019re careful, take your time while packing orders, relax in the armchair, or take your pills, you\u2019ll be just fine. You might not even notice that something\u2019s off.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094300/extras/86c7a66ee60275e341b1a94eef0675ee.poster.avif?t=1762206324\" width=800 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094300/extras/86c7a66ee60275e341b1a94eef0675ee.webm?t=1762206324\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094300/extras/86c7a66ee60275e341b1a94eef0675ee.mp4?t=1762206324\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094300/extras/6db8aee90f84d86bf9f5c7d1c8a63eaa.avif?t=1762206324\" width=783 height=78 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The game is about all of us. We work more and more, often forgetting to take proper care of ourselves. We sleep less, eat worse, and stress more - all to survive, pay our mortgages, and put food on the table.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">I wanted to take all of that and exaggerate it, but while creating the game, I couldn\u2019t escape the feeling that <i>Happy Worker Tool Company</i>, though meant as satire, still mirrors the reality we live in far too closely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><u><i>I\u2019d like to dedicate it to everyone who feels they work too hard.</i></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094300/extras/4a429f8bcd4d3057f44a66dea009c1aa.poster.avif?t=1762206324\" width=800 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094300/extras/4a429f8bcd4d3057f44a66dea009c1aa.webm?t=1762206324\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094300/extras/4a429f8bcd4d3057f44a66dea009c1aa.mp4?t=1762206324\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: right\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094300/extras/b70a15945de2d50d7535d3cc4ae63dbd.avif?t=1762206324\" width=800 height=200 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4094300?t=1762206324","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094300/dc2d73d1c188de11c2d84ad9fe89a8c05a72d6ad/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762206324","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094300/64fe45807f389814dc1a9efcd8e8012ba2d6d411/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762206324","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094300/64fe45807f389814dc1a9efcd8e8012ba2d6d411/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762206324","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game contains themes of psychological distress, mental instability, and implied violence. Certain scenes include mild depictions of blood and disturbing imagery related to workplace accidents. The story explores manipulation, fear, and oppression under an authoritarian regime.\r\n\r\nThere are no depictions of sexual content, drug abuse, or explicit physical violence. The mature themes are presented through atmosphere, narrative, and environmental storytelling rather than graphic scenes."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094300/extras/a5b8553dfc9ddc7f6eb6f255502683d6.avif?t=1762206324\" width=783 height=278 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094300/extras/6b01613ad783fbc4715be6850c20d53c.avif?t=1762206324\" width=783 height=78 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>HWTC</i> is a mix of psychological horror and work simulation set in the fictional post-Soviet state, the Republic of Calvania. You\u2019ll be exploring difficult themes that are part of our everyday lives - routine, negligence, and mental health - all while listening to the encouraging, Council-approved radio station.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Few things are said directly, but many are left for your interpretation. The warehouse, the notes, and the radio tell a story - but you\u2019re the one who puts it together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Getting most of the achievements and story elements will take around 2\u20133 hours, but the game doesn\u2019t end there - you can complete as many shifts as you like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094300/extras/aa3b09b81b9e6322dd4cf0f30c30ed91.poster.avif?t=1762206324\" width=800 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094300/extras/aa3b09b81b9e6322dd4cf0f30c30ed91.webm?t=1762206324\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094300/extras/aa3b09b81b9e6322dd4cf0f30c30ed91.mp4?t=1762206324\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094300/extras/f22418d64276cc6e82ae456265338107.avif?t=1762206324\" width=783 height=78 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Your working shifts are the core of the game - you <strong>check</strong>, <strong>pack</strong>, and <strong>send orders</strong>. Hard work and attention to detail are rewarded; carelessness, on the other hand, is noticed and punished.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Each day is an <strong>eight-hour night shift</strong> with no limit on the number of orders you can pack. Every shift, <strong>the conveyor configuration changes</strong>, making your tasks easier or harder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Your time and space management will be thoroughly tested - you\u2019ll need <strong>shelves</strong> to organize your work, an eye for detail to spot signs of <strong>electric fuses</strong> nearing their limits, and careful planning to stay <strong>sane</strong> throughout the process.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094300/extras/bff9f21e80c0d9ba3cfab8718958222b.poster.avif?t=1762206324\" width=800 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094300/extras/bff9f21e80c0d9ba3cfab8718958222b.webm?t=1762206324\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094300/extras/bff9f21e80c0d9ba3cfab8718958222b.mp4?t=1762206324\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094300/extras/b11d3459b467549f8fecc83e197e8dd1.avif?t=1762206324\" width=783 height=78 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Work is demanding, tiring, and you\u2019ve already suffered enough. The closer you get to a <strong>mental breakdown</strong>, the more unfriendly things become - whispers, flickering lights, silent conveyor belts. But don\u2019t worry - <strong>the game isn\u2019t about jump scares</strong>; it\u2019s about a dense, dark atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">And if you\u2019re careful, take your time while packing orders, relax in the armchair, or take your pills, you\u2019ll be just fine. You might not even notice that something\u2019s off.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094300/extras/86c7a66ee60275e341b1a94eef0675ee.poster.avif?t=1762206324\" width=800 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094300/extras/86c7a66ee60275e341b1a94eef0675ee.webm?t=1762206324\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094300/extras/86c7a66ee60275e341b1a94eef0675ee.mp4?t=1762206324\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094300/extras/6db8aee90f84d86bf9f5c7d1c8a63eaa.avif?t=1762206324\" width=783 height=78 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The game is about all of us. We work more and more, often forgetting to take proper care of ourselves. We sleep less, eat worse, and stress more - all to survive, pay our mortgages, and put food on the table.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">I wanted to take all of that and exaggerate it, but while creating the game, I couldn\u2019t escape the feeling that <i>Happy Worker Tool Company</i>, though meant as satire, still mirrors the reality we live in far too closely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><u><i>I\u2019d like to dedicate it to everyone who feels they work too hard.</i></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094300/extras/4a429f8bcd4d3057f44a66dea009c1aa.poster.avif?t=1762206324\" width=800 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094300/extras/4a429f8bcd4d3057f44a66dea009c1aa.webm?t=1762206324\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094300/extras/4a429f8bcd4d3057f44a66dea009c1aa.mp4?t=1762206324\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: right\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\