>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD Graphics 4600 / NVIDIA GTX 750 / AMD Radeon R7 250<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 750 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Any basic integrated one<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Works on most modern integrated GPUs and laptops</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8400 / AMD Ryzen 3 1200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1050 Ti / AMD RX 560 or better<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Standard</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Piotr Wyszy\u0144ski"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia\nMedo\nLinguagem impr\u00f3pria","rating":"14","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"14","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Horror\nSchimpfw\u00f6rte","rating":"16","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"16","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"21 Nov, 2025"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094300/1b17c6097acfef91871b612f9488e55eb48d555a/ss_1b17c6097acfef91871b612f9488e55eb48d555a.1920x1080.jpg?t=1762206324","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094300/1b17c6097acfef91871b612f9488e55eb48d555a/ss_1b17c6097acfef91871b612f9488e55eb48d555a.600x338.jpg?t=1762206324"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094300/a3e07bdc8454972352cd50417433cf209b0412f7/ss_a3e07bdc8454972352cd50417433cf209b0412f7.19